{"answer": 2, "html": "\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">1</span> 밑을 맞춘다</div>\n    $$\n    3^{\\,x-6}=3^{-2x}.\n    $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">2</span> 지수를 비교한다</div>\n    $$\n    x-6=-2x,\\qquad 3x=6,\\qquad x=2.\n    $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-final\">답 &nbsp;\\(\\mathbf{2}\\)</div>\n"}